{"url": "https://data.stats.gov.cn/dg/website/publicrelease/web/external/new/queryIndexTreeAsync?pid=1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1&code=3", "body": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-26T11:16:52-0500", "response": {"data": [{"explain": "1995-1996年，除房地产投资、农村集体投资、个人投资以外，投资统计的起点为5万元；自1997年起，除房地产投资、农村集体投资、个人投资以外，投资统计的起点由5万元提高到50万元；自2011年起,除房地产投资、农村个人投资外，固定资产投资的统计起点由50万元提高至500万元。为便于比较，1996、2010年数据作了相应调整。\n从2011年起，城镇固定资产投资数据发布口径改为固定资产投资（不含农户），固定资产投资（不含农户）等于原口径的城镇固定资产投资加上农村企事业组织的项目投资。", "sdate": null, "_name": "全社会固定资产投资", "treeinfo_pid": "1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1", "treeinfo_level": 4, "type": "catalog", "edate": null, "isLeaf": true, "treeinfo_globalid": "69c574ab128a44e595cc0b24502b771b.884c062607104a91967b22742537f44f.1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1.607a7cd4b50e4553894472475d1f4273", "name": "全社会固定资产投资", "_id": "607a7cd4b50e4553894472475d1f4273", "publicrelease_web_catalog_id": "607a7cd4b50e4553894472475d1f4273", "treeinfo_icon": null}, {"explain": null, "sdate": "1996", "_name": "全社会固定资产投资实际到位资金增长情况", "treeinfo_pid": "1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1", "treeinfo_level": 4, "type": "catalog", "edate": null, "isLeaf": true, "treeinfo_globalid": "69c574ab128a44e595cc0b24502b771b.884c062607104a91967b22742537f44f.1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1.c13fecc9f70a47b18f39e9f5241cf04b", "name": "全社会固定资产投资实际到位资金增长情况", "_id": "c13fecc9f70a47b18f39e9f5241cf04b", "publicrelease_web_catalog_id": "c13fecc9f70a47b18f39e9f5241cf04b", "treeinfo_icon": null}, {"explain": null, "sdate": null, "_name": "民间固定资产（不含农户）投资额及增速", "treeinfo_pid": "1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1", "treeinfo_level": 4, "type": "catalog", "edate": null, "isLeaf": true, "treeinfo_globalid": "69c574ab128a44e595cc0b24502b771b.884c062607104a91967b22742537f44f.1d83863d4983470f834cb2e569bb2ad1.975bf8699a3a433b8d1d5e42e89525ca", "name": "民间固定资产（不含农户）投资额及增速", "_id": "975bf8699a3a433b8d1d5e42e89525ca", "publicrelease_web_catalog_id": "975bf8699a3a433b8d1d5e42e89525ca", "treeinfo_icon": null}, {"explain": null, "sdate